# One female, from switch-on
# Everything one female does on her own, in order. All three females behave identically;
# they differ only in how hungry they start, and so in when they begin looking.

0 Her motor is powered and holds her still, facing wherever she was left. Only her feet are lit.
-> female-appetite-lights
17 For the first seconds she stands still while her appetites climb out of the satisfied range. Female 2 begins after about 2 seconds (she starts hungriest), females 1 and 3 after about 17 seconds.
-> female-looking
0 From here on she is looking: turning back and forth, reading the light in front of her. Nothing on her body shows whether she has recognised anyone.
0 She stays that way until she recognises a male who wants what she wants. Then she stops, and would begin the exchange that satisfies them both - the part that is not built yet, so she simply stays stopped.
0 She only stops when the whole installation is shut down: her head, belly and feet go out and she stops turning.
